{"id":"schlamm","lemma":"Schlamm","pos":"noun","rank":4556,"glosses":["mud","sludge, ooze"],"ipa":"/ʃlam/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/c/c6/De-Schlamm.ogg/De-Schlamm.ogg.mp3","gender":"m","forms":{"genitive":"Schlammes","plural":"Schlämme"},"examples":[{"text":"Das Auto blieb im Schlamm stecken.","en":"The car was stuck in the mud.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/593107","words":[{"g":"the / that"},{"g":"car"},{"g":"to remain","l":"bleiben"},{"g":"in the"},null,{"g":"to stick"}]},{"text":"Unser Auto steckt im Schlamm fest.","en":"Our car is stuck in the mud.","words":[{"g":"our"},{"g":"car"},{"g":"to stick","l":"stecken"},{"g":"in the"},null,{"g":"firm"}]},{"text":"Im Schlamm zu spielen gefällt uns!","en":"We like playing in mud.","words":[{"g":"in the"},null,{"g":"to / too"},{"g":"to play"},{"g":"to please","l":"gefallen"},{"g":"us","l":"wir"}]},{"text":"Der Hund ist mit Schlamm bedeckt.","en":"The dog is covered in mud.","words":[{"g":"the"},{"g":"dog, hound"},{"g":"is","l":"sein"},{"g":"with"},null,{"g":"covered"}]},{"text":"Die Jungen spielten im Schlamm.","en":"The boys played in the mud.","words":[{"g":"the"},{"g":"to give birth"},{"g":"to play","l":"spielen"},{"g":"in the"},null]}]}